hivepack-deflate is a port of zlib (https://zlib.net) to Rust and is
distributed under the license of the code it is derived from, below. It is an
altered version of zlib: the C source has been translated to Rust, and the
changes are marked in the source with comments that start with
"Differs from zlib:".

